rewerc - optimized web anti-framework 
----------------------------------------------

Rewerc is a content management system designed to be simple to
use, simple to setup, simple to hack on, and not get on the way while allowing
users easy customization.

For more information see the official, original website: http://werc.cat-v.org/
License
-------

Werc is in the public domain.

